Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二十二集 蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now that we were heading into high summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.04,0:00:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我们正在步入盛夏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:37.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was time for one of the most enjoyable jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:37.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是时候完成农事日历中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on the farming calendar:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最令人愉悦的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}putting the cows back in the fields
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把冬天关在大棚里的奶牛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:46.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}after their winter confinement in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:46.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}赶回田地里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so we get four in the trailer and off to Cow Ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 我们把四头赶进拖车里 然后出发去奶牛牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Open that gate up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I like working with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在喜欢跟你合作了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, you didn't used to? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么 你以前不喜欢? - 不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on then, cows. Good cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走吧 奶牛 乖乖牛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Go on. Yes. Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 上去 - 对咯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 继续走 - 这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:16.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:16.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you gonna go on your own and I'll get the next four in?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你自己去行吗?我再赶四头牛进来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is one of my favourite days,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.32,0:01:24.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}将奶牛送回地里是我最爱的日子之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}releasing the cows into the fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because they're so happy after... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.76,0:01:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}关了多久了? 它们在谷仓里关了五六个月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.12,0:01:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Five, six months being locked up in the barn?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They suddenly have the freedom, all that grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后突然获得自由 在那草地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's like: "Oh, I remember."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们就像是在说:“我记得!”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I arrived at the cow field,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我到了奶牛牧场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}remembering well the last time we did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很清楚地记得上次放牛回去的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at them! Excited cows!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看它们!兴奋的奶牛!自由啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就对了!非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I'm free and out!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我自由了 我出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he released the raptors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在可以放飞“猛禽”了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There. You're free. Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.52,0:02:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 你们自由了 现在出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on! Where's all the running around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 怎么不跑了?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:28.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're supposed to dance around and be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们应该跳舞 应该开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You ungrateful bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们这群忘恩负义的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After that letdown, I went to inspect my Space Penises,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经历了失望以后 我前去检查我的太空阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fully expecting some more disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我预计会更加失望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我相当乐观地带了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm rather optimistically going to bring...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One crate? Two crates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一...两个板条箱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two crates for my mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}带了两个用来装蘑菇的板条箱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll get into my Darth Vader outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}穿上达斯维达式制服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My rubber gloves on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}戴上橡胶手套
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yay! Holy Moly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at those.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看那些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And those!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有那些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at these beauties. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.16,0:03:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这些漂亮的蘑菇 看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This could work. This could actually work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这行得通 真的行得通
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what you do to pick them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么采摘蘑菇呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's a twisting, strangling motion like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.32,0:03:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是把它扭下来 像绞杀一样...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's not quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不太对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God! I'm having mushrooms on toast tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 我今晚要吃蘑菇吐司
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having boxed up the mushrooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把蘑菇装箱后...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I high-tailed it over to the farm shop
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before it opened for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我迅速赶在农场商店 开门营业前赶到店里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 丽莎 - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've got good news. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我有个好消息 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow! They're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们太美了 - 是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They are, aren't they? - What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是什么品种? - 灰蚝菇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Grey oyster mushrooms. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 - 我给它们做了个小黑板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've made a thing for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特产的蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we're selling them by the punnet. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们要用小篮子卖这些蘑菇 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much do you reckon for a punnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得一篮要卖多少钱? 我觉得3英镑、3.5英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I say £3, £3,50. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 然后我们把它们拿给斯科特看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then went to show them to Scott,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the chef in the shop's burger van.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是商店汉堡车的大厨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Wow. - Aren't they beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 看这些蘑菇 - 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are all grown up at the... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 漂亮吧? - 这些是种在...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're growing these. We're gonna have a regular supply of mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对! - 这些是我们种的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can do mushrooms on toast or something in the mornings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.24,0:04:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们将有定期供应的蘑菇 - 大约18
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:24.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, mushrooms on toast. Yeah! Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们早上可以吃蘑菇吐司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:24.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 蘑菇吐司 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Everybody wants mushrooms on toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家都想吃蘑菇吐司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can make mushroom ketchup if you get to the end and you've got loads left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果最后还剩了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh! - Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们或许可以做蘑菇酱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah? - Mushroom soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 蘑菇汤?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想怎么做都行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Vegan burger. - Yeah!
