Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not 96 kilograms. That's heavier than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是96千克 那比我都重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好吧 绿色 - 那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, don't let go until we've sprayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 喷好颜料再放开 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:11.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, just spray. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 就喷上去 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, don't let go! Bring it back or else we're gonna lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别放开它 让它回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它要跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:20.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wait, I'm just... Oh, my God. We're gonna be here for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 我只是...天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们得在这里称好几天 - 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, you've gotta get it in the middle. - It's heavy enough, I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这样不行 - 这只他妈的够重量了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你得把它放到中间 - 我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This one's just coughed and been sick all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这只刚刚咳嗽了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还吐了一地 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get off. Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}松嘴 松嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This one is 16 with two back legs on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这只16千克 它两条后腿没离地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's not accurate. - That is definitely over 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.76,0:08:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那样称不准 - 它肯定超过17千克了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In the middle of this festival of incompetence...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.16,0:08:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们挣扎给羊称重的过程中...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:41.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来吧 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lizzie, the goat expert, arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...山羊专家莉齐来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 莉齐!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Weighing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在给它们称重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How's that going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 进展如何? - 不太顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Not very well. - No! You surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 你让我大吃一惊 - 我们怎么说的 18点...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What did we say? 18 point...? But we haven't marked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 但我们还没给它做标记 - 我做了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:57.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have. - Oh, you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. - Is there an easier way of doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有更简单的办法吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I can definitely think of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有 我当然能想到一个 那就是用磅秤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like, use the scales. That would be my recommendation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我建议用磅秤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you make a goat stand on a weigh scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么让山羊站在磅秤上呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just, he'll stand there. It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就...它会站上去的 能行的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So in fact, that's plugged into the mains, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}电源已经插上了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. We're all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 准备好了 你就站在屏幕旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you stand by the screen when I put him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 我把山羊放上去时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It should give you a weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该能看到重量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, yeah. 19.46. - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 19.46
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So how... Ow! That really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这样就行了 那么... - 那怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're getting weighed next for being a horrible goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那真的很疼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}接下来轮到你上秤了 谁让你是个可怕的山羊呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ Al-bloody-mighty. This is a porker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这只真重
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow. 28.66.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.96,0:09:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇 28.66
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下次 你别把手放在...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Next time, if you put your hand not... - Yes, I've got that wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 我抱的姿势错了 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}23.92.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 23.92 - 你把山羊养得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you have grown good, solid, healthy goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又结实又健康
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we're happy? - We're very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.36,0:09:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 我们很开心 - 我们很开心 非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've done a very good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All of these boys are certainly over seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些公山羊肯定都超过17千克了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And very ready to go out. - Ready to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 准备好出去了 - 准备得非常充分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:09:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:09:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Before moving the goats to their campsite,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在把山羊转移到其营地前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there was something I needed to clear up with Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要跟莉齐搞清楚一些事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's this I heard about... Well, I was reading in my book,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我听说...我在书里看到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that if they escape then they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它们逃跑了 那它们...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That would... Yeah, like... Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}松开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- If you get the... Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果你... - 嘿 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you get the fencing wrong, it's carnage,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.96,0:10:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你围栏装错了 那就麻烦大了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because you'll never keep them in, like, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你永远无法让它们待在里面 永远都不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once they learn... They're so clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦它们学会了 它们非常聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If they start escaping, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它们开始逃跑 那就拦不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I think it's trying to. Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得它挺卖力的 - 天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry, what were you saying about the fencing being catastrophic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对不起 你刚刚说... - 好了好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...围栏灾难什么来着?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be catastrophic if you don't get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你没安好围栏 那会是一场大灾难
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So... Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:49.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Do you want a lunch box? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:49.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你需要“私人包裹”吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I need a cricket... They know. - You need a cricket box. They do know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他需要 他需要那种板球护具 - 它们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's because I cut their balls off. That really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们真的知道 - 就因为我让它们做了绝育
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好疼 - 它们不那样对丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 别再这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do not. Don't do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别...别再这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}放开!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They used to be so sweet. They were so small and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们以前很乖的 - 它们以前又小又乖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now they're just eating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.68,0:11:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在就只知道吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But if one does keep getting out... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但如果有一只一直出去... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Best will in the world, what damage is it going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.68,0:11:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然它绝对不可能做到 但那会有什么危害?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Apart from kicking people in the nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了踹人的蛋蛋?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we had one really bad group years and years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多年前 我们有一群特别糟糕的山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and they went for all our sapling trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们毁坏了我们所有的树苗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they went through two fields to get to the sapling trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们还穿过了两块田才到树苗边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They could go onto the road and cause an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们可能会到公路上 造成事故
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or your chillies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.20,0:11:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者吃掉你的辣椒 我不知道它们会吃多少...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I don't know how many they'd eat... - They wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不会吧 - ...但它们会穿过你的塑料大棚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They would certainly go through your polytunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Horns in a polytunnel wouldn't be a good mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}山羊角和塑料大棚 结果可不会太好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:34.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, really, we've gotta be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我们真的得非常小心 - 真的必须小心 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You really, really do, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you imagine-- - Look at Joe. He's in real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 你能想象... - 看看乔 他有大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here's our decoy here. - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.56,0:11:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他是我们的诱饵 - 我扛着一头!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It likes you a lot. Literally nothing's sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得它很喜欢你 - 可以说它们什么都不放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then showed Lizzie the field where the goats would live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我们给莉齐展示了 山羊居住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I leave this alone for much longer, it will all just be bramble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我再不管这块地 它就会完全被荆棘覆盖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. They'll take the worst of the brambles out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 它们会除掉最糟糕的荆棘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And at every opportunity, she came back to the topic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次一有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of their escaping skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}她都会说回到山羊逃跑技巧的话题上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And do they need things to climb on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...它们没有据点 - 它们需要东西爬上去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We don't give them stuff outside because they roll them into the electric fence
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们倾向于别在外面给它们东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and then use that as an escape. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们会把那些东西滚到电网里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后以此作为逃跑工具 - 不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错哦 - 就像空军三号战俘营一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Like Stalag Luft III? - Yeah, honestly. Like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 说实话 - 什么 所以它们...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, so rewind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们回顾一下 如果我们 把它们谷仓里现有的木质玩具...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we put their sort of wooden toys they've got in their barn now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and put them in here, they'll use them as a launching pad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - ...放到这里 它们会把玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. We found that with the big sort of oil barrels?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}推到围栏边 把它们当作发射台
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我们发现有那种大型油桶时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They roll them up into the fence to short it out or use them to hop over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会把桶滚到围栏边
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:37.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's so cool. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要么让围栏短路 要么利用油桶跳过去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是吧 - 太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'll definitely be up on that pig hut
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 如果有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and over that fence, like, within hours if they had access to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们一定会在几小时内
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 爬上猪窝 越过树篱 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus. Clever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.68,0:12:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 - 很聪明吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're very intelligent. Do not underestimate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们非常聪明 不要低估它们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we were wondering if a goat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们考虑山羊 能否骑摩托车跳过围栏时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}could jump a fence on a motorcycle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and Charlie were having a much grander day
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和查理在伦敦 度过了更美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'd been invited to Downing Street
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们受邀前往唐宁街与首相会谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to talk to the Prime Minister
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about his "Back British Farm to Fork" initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论“从农场到餐桌”计划
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And given the importance of the meeting, they met in a café
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唐宁街 SW1 威斯敏斯特市
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for a pre-match chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于会议的重要性 他们在咖啡馆见面 事先聊一聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So today? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 今天...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Quite a lot of people going. - Quite big?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.84,0:13:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 很多人去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很盛大 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jeremy told me to say... He said: "Kaleb, erm,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米跟我说 “卡莱布 如果你想表达任何观点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if you want any talking points,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你就跟瑞希说 他可能不会再当首相了”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}just tell Ricky that he's probably not going to be Prime Minister anymore."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Rishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 里希 - 里希
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Rishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The president. The prime minister, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总统...抱歉 应该是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, that'll be a great place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}叫他“总统”来开始交谈应该挺好的 我会说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I would definitely go: "Oi. Hello, Mr President.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“你好 总统先生” - 我还在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you, Ricky?" -"Come and see me on the weekend".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你周末会来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"You won't be Prime Minister for long."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.28,0:13:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你下次不能当首相了”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what are you gonna talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你要谈什么?你的重点是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What's your focus? I'll do it on young farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.52,0:13:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我想聚焦在年轻农民身上 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Good. - Young people getting into farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 让年轻人开始务农 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't go and farm your own farm nowadays.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现如今 你不能自己去农场里做农活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A, they're so expensive. And B, everything's in a scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 价格太高 其次 一切都在一个系统计划内
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I got a quote for a tractor yesterday. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我昨天收到了 一辆拖拉机的报价
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After discount, it's £205,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 打折后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. It's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 二十万零五千英镑 - 太离谱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, Christ. We'd better go. - Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Trafalgar Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}特拉法加广场
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I drove through here! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我开车来过这里 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't put my indicator on in this junction here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在这个路口没有开转向灯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's Nelson, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是尼尔森 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's Nelson? - He was an admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尼尔森是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是海军上将
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's up quite high up. - He won a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.20,0:14:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他挺高的 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Do you know what he's looking at? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.40,0:14:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他曾赢过一场战役 你知道他在看什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You see where those flags are? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看到那些旗帜所在的地方... - 看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's Admiralty Arch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是海军拱门 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:34.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- OK? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 他在看拱门的顶部
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.76,0:14:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's looking on the top of the arch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are loads of ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那儿很多船
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And he's looking at that. - He led the Battle of Trafalgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 他在看那个?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他领导了特拉法加战役 对抗法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All that concrete to build a man that's looking over some...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了建造一个看着“我爱伦敦”的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I Heart London." Fuck that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}竟然用了那么多混凝土 真让人气愤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Press the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要按按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You press the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你按按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等待
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are we going? We're going down Whitehall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:14:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们要去白厅 那是... - 那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a... Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是...是个很... - 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a very... Just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就继续走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So here we are. This is Whitehall, this is where it all happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.32,0:15:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们到了 这是白厅 这就是一切发生的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}发生什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The management of the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}国家管理 到了 内阁办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go. Cabinet offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是什么? - 你知道内阁是什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that? - You know what the Cabinet is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. - They're the more senior ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道 - 他们算是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}更高级的部长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they all work in there, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们都在那里工作 对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what time it is. What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道现在几点了 几点?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}9:11.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}9点11分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, we're a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们来得有点早 到处逛逛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.52,0:15:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you now just gonna try and get
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在是在试着 让人们说“早上好”吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- people to say "good morning"? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.84,0:15:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They'll think you're a fruitcake. - I'm just saying "morning"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.84,0:15:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们会以为你疯了 - 我只是在说“早上好”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They-- They don't wanna talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们不想说话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Soon it was time for them to head for that famous black door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:16:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 他们该前往 那扇著名的黑色大门了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready? We gotta knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.16,0:16:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了?我们要敲门?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 要敲门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Christ, all right. You might need to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, knock?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?敲门
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you want to step in. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.56,0:16:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱歉?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.52,0:16:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们不进来吗? - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, guys. You all right? How're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 你们好 还好吗? - 你还好吗?谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是提示一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you knock that loud again, I'll throw you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:22.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你再敲那么大声 我就把你扔出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Say that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你能再说一次吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't knock so loud. Sorry, we're farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别敲那么大声
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起 我们是农民
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't care. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.64,0:16:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:36.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While Kaleb and Charlie were being told off
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:36.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当卡莱布和查理被唐宁街门口的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by the Downing Street door police...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}警察训斥时...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, goats. Let's get you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 来吧 山羊 我们带你们进去 - 走 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa and I were finally moving the goats
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...丽莎和我终于 把山羊转移到它们的新家了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into their new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the idea is... This is their training garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的设想是 这是它们的训练花园
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep. And they live in here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 它们住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until they've really eaten all the dock leaves and what have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}直到它们吃完所有酸模叶 和其他叶子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Okay. - Then you move them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 然后你会把它们转移到下面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the idea is that their mouths get,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等它们的嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you know, used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 习惯了...没错 - 长硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:17:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hardened. - Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh! - And they get hard mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会有坚硬的嘴巴了 但然后 你能看到荆棘丛吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you see the bramble bushes, which is what I want them to start eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我真正想让它们吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. - So when they start hitting brambles,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等它们开始吃荆棘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's going to be interesting for me. That's what I want them to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就觉得有意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那正是我想让它们吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Before all that, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.88,0:17:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在那之前 我们得经历不怎么愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to go through the unpleasant but necessary business
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但又必须完成的事 那就是让它们习惯电击围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of getting them used to the electric fencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:25.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Out you come. They are coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So the white fence is gentle power. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以白色围栏是柔和电力 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the orange fence is the national grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.64,0:17:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}橙色围栏是国家电网提供的强电
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look: "I'm plotting... I've got an escape route here."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看它们在密谋 “我这儿有条逃跑路线
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Hey, guys. Follow me."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“嘿 各位 跟着我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.32,0:17:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I reckon we could be over in a jiffy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.32,0:17:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我发现我们很快就能越过围栏”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa! Was that a zap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.24,0:17:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是一股电流吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no. They're eating the gate posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 它们在吃门柱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:51.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Okay, I'm not eating the gate posts anymore!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.08,0:17:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“好的 我不会再吃门柱了”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:17:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, it's really mild. And look... - It's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没事 这很温和 它们... - 这不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I shouldn't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.08,0:18:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不应该笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not amused. I don't like to see animals in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But they do have to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不喜欢看见动物受苦 但它们必须学习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And quite quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 它们就明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they got the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, look at them all now, in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但现在看看它们 都在中间 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - Their escape plans are in tatters
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我的安保措施 它们的逃跑计划破灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.80,0:18:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because of my security.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get your mouths hardened and then you can go and eat brambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让嘴长硬
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.76,0:18:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后你们就可以去吃荆棘了 - 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at Number 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回到唐宁街10号
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie was taking part in a highbrow think-tank discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理正在参加一场高知间的讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But you went through the list of grants there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你看了那份资助清单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And you haven't listed them all? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而你并没有把它们都列出来 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And all the schemes? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还有所有计划 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You do need a PhD now in grant applications if you're a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.08,0:18:55.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你是农民 你还得是个博士 才能搞懂那些补助申请
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meanwhile, out in the garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:19:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 在花园外 里奇首相开启了闲聊模式
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:19:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}President Ricky was in full schmooze mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you? Rishi, very nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我的主要... - 你好吗?里奇 幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what are you guys... Is this all from the farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.04,0:19:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还好 你呢? - 你有什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, from the farms. We've got a Fenland Flag sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.48,0:19:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这都是农场里产的? - 是的 是农场里的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:09.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们有芬兰旗香肠 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then we've got our traditional butcher's sausage, our Great Bramblebee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的传统肉店香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah? That's... - And then some bacon going as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们布兰博比农场培育的 - 好的 那...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God! It's been smelling. We were having Cabinet up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们还有一些培根 - 天啊!闻起来...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Literally, that's the Cabinet room there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们之前在上面那里开内阁会议 - 我打赌那...是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And everyone was just distracted and smelling your stuff coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 那里就是内阁室 大家闻到你的香肠的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都分心了 这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, in the actual Cabinet office...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 在真正的内阁办公室里...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好吗? - 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb got to meet the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...卡莱布去见首相了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks for coming. Kaleb! How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 感谢到来 卡莱布 你好吗? - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This was his big moment
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而这是他大谈吸引年轻人 投身农业的重大时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to talk about attracting youngsters into farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you okay? - I'm very well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你还好吗? - 我很好 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You've got lovely hair. - Er, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你头发真茂密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Had you heard otherwise? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 是真的很茂密! - 有人说过它不茂密吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It was just a general comment. - I just like hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这只是一般评论 - 不 我只是喜欢头发
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When the conversation moved outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当谈话地点转移到室外后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb finally did talk about young farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.44,0:19:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布终于能讨论年轻农民的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}商业联通
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The thing is in my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我脑子里一直在想这事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But he made a bit of a meal about getting to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但他在谈及要点的时候绕了圈子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, farming's not a job. It's a way of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}务农不是一项工作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它是一种生活方式 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is it. There's no other option there. It's a way of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这样 这没有其他选择 它是一种生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't get up and go: "I've gotta go to work today."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不会起来说:“我今天要去工作”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I never ever wake up and go:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我从来不会醒来说:“知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I've really gotta work, I've got an 8 to 5 job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我今天得去工作 我得朝八晚五
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't wait to finish."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“等不及完成工作了” 过了半天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Halfway through the day, you go: "Oh, I wanna go home."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你吃了午饭 然后说:“我想回家”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I never do that. I wake up and go: "Right, what am I doing today?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我从来不做这种事 我醒来会说:“我今天要做什么?”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yesterday... The day before, sorry. I was out there milking cows...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.00,0:20:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}昨天...是前一天 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我早上在外面给奶牛挤奶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then I went out there and started mowing for silage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.28,0:20:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我开始割草准备青贮饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then I was spraying. No day is the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 兄弟 赶紧说重点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我喷化肥 每天都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Everyone should have a dream. - That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得每个人都应该有一个梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A dream is somewhere to go and to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 应该如此 - 因为有梦想才会有追求
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As soon as you accomplish that dream, if you do it in 2, 3 or 5 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只要你能在两年、三年、五年内 实现这个梦想 你就成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you've done it, set another dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托...我得管理国家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the thing I say all the time is dreams don't work unless you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再设置另一个梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直说梦想不会实现 除非你...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While Kaleb was bringing the country to a grinding halt,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在卡莱布让这个国家陷入停顿时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa and I had gone up to the mushroom bunker
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎和我去了蘑菇堡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to see if any more had fruited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看是否有更多收获
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, my God. Have they not grown?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我的天啊! - 它们还没长出来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:04.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:04.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我的老天爷啊! - 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look! How many have we got? Thousands!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这景象...看我们有多少 数千...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God. So those are those.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!那些就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.72,0:21:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow. Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 哇 - 天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.24,0:21:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些都已经成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're very ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经熟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 24 hours ago, that didn't exist. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}24小时前 这些都还不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where does the matter come from that's made it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这玩意从哪儿来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In 24 hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道 哪儿? - 在24小时内?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:37.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You need to get selling mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.92,0:21:40.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得去卖蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's more, the extraordinary lion's mane mushrooms
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外 了不起的猴头菇也开始成熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had started to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh wow! - It's like a sponge
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哇!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's mated with a cauliflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这像海绵和花椰菜的杂交成果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's a mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The man said that he reckons that they're space penises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.32,0:21:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个人说他认为蘑菇是太空阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That does look like it's from space. That really does.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这确实看起来像是太空来的 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There was no way we could fit even a tenth of this lot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场商店连十分之一的蘑菇都装不下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.40,0:22:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into the farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I had to abandon my plans for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 我不得不放弃当天的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and man a hastily erected mushroom stall.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后去临时搭建的蘑菇摊位上工作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.60,0:22:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇 仅限今日
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I interest you in the new Diddly Squat range?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我介绍一下迪丽斯库阿特农场 推出的新产品
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Grey oyster mushrooms. These are not like you get at the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}灰蚝菇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or lion's mane mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这与超市里卖的不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者猴头菇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}May I have some of both? - Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我可以两种都买一些吗? - 当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's 427 grams.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}灰蚝菇20克 20便士 100克 2英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是427克
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.12,0:22:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That would be £12,81. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.12,0:22:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总共12.81英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.32,0:22:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.24,0:22:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just out of curiosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.16,0:22:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是好奇 你们在卖“太空阴茎”?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.04,0:22:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you selling Space Penises?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.76,0:22:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太空阴茎 只限今日!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up in Piggy Wood, it had now been 11 weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在小猪树林里 自从公猪阿贾克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.28,0:23:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}since Ajax the boar had done...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.28,0:23:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}前来...与母猪交配 已经过了11周
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}boar things with the sows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.72,0:23:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}These are the four in question,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.72,0:23:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是待检测的四头
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- hopefully pregnant. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 希望它们已经怀孕了 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So a local pig expert had come round to scan them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.76,0:23:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以一位当地猪专家来给它们做检查
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.44,0:23:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the news was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.44,0:23:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.08,0:23:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're all pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.08,0:23:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们全都怀孕了 - 它们全都怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They're all pregnant? - All up the duff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.52,0:23:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 全部都怀孕了? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.48,0:23:26.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we don't have to sell them. If they hadn't have been up the duff,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.48,0:23:26.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不必卖掉它们了 因为如果它们没怀孕的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they're just eating food for no reason and they'd have to be bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们就是在白吃白喝 那它们将不得不变成培根
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Gerald! Hello, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰拉德! - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, Gerald! Hello, hello! Ooh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.20,0:23:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰拉德 你好啊 抱歉! - 你好啊 丽莎!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你还好吗? - 还好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.56,0:23:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lovely piggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.56,0:23:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可爱的猪猪 - 它们很棒吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.60,0:23:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Aren't they great? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.60,0:23:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 你养过猪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.84,0:23:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You ever kept pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, this is the mothers. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁买的这个...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 这是猪妈妈 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've heard stories about sows and boars. They can be nasty, can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我听过关于母猪和公猪的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What can?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.24,0:23:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们可能很恶心 对吧? - 什么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sows and... When they got below the right stuff with the combine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.08,0:23:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}母猪...当它们在下面...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:59.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then you... When they got things coming out the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们交配时 需要遮挡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.40,0:23:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当它们有那些...从侧面出来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gerald? - Yes, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰拉德 - 亲爱的 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.92,0:24:08.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you planted all these trees, was it 60 years ago or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.92,0:24:08.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么时候种的这些树 是六十年前吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You planted these trees? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.16,0:24:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 这些树是你种的?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 60 years ago. - No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 六十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.96,0:24:12.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.96,0:24:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是吧! - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This was all...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.28,0:24:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些树一直疯长 长得到处都是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.04,0:24:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All the way up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.04,0:24:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后...是的 它们直接在这里放牧... 这些都...还有那边的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They grazed right to the... These were all... And all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.56,0:24:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So these trees are younger than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.56,0:24:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这些树比你年轻?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.24,0:24:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is Gerald's wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 这是杰拉德的树林
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You used to get the old shovel like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.96,0:24:31.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你以前会像这样用旧铲子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Wow, Gerald. - And then,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.44,0:24:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 哇 杰拉德 - 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.08,0:24:34.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}drop the thing and then heel 'em in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.08,0:24:34.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把铲子插进去 然后用脚踩进去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went round with the...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.96,0:24:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我带着...当时叫什么来着 很搞笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bend it with a pole with all the fluid in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.56,0:24:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用一根杆子把它弄弯 用水... 里面的液体
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As the years went on, like,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.04,0:24:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着岁月的流逝 有...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.24,0:24:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there was all those Wellingtonias, all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.24,0:24:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有那些威灵顿杉树之类的就都...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They were original wood, they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们都是原始森林 这些...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 至少两周一次 拿到...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.12,0:24:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At least once a fortnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.36,0:24:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}got the...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stinging nettles.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:24:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 刺荨麻 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:00.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Similar to that, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:25:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与之类似
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's when bosses were bosses and you didn't say no to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个时候就体现出老板的权威了 你不能拒绝他们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们就...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm really chuffed. I did not know that you'd done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.20,0:25:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我真的很开心 我之前不知道 这些树是你种的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it shall become known-- We shall rename it Gerald's Wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它应该为人所知 我们要把它改名为“杰拉德森林”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.64,0:25:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We used to fill it up right in a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.64,0:25:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们过去常把它填满
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.64,0:25:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}稍微低于作物上方的顶部
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We were now well into June,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在进入六月了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and life on the farm was a smorgasbord of busyness.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场生活将非常忙碌
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.72,0:25:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up in a field called Downs Ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.72,0:25:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在一块叫做“唐斯地”的田野里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I took part in my first ever grass harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我参与了人生中第一次割草
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This involved wrapping bales of grass in plastic sheeting,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:49.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中涉及用塑料膜包裹草捆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which we'd feed to the cows in the winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们冬天会用它们来喂牛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we're collecting silage, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们在收集青贮饲料 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.40,0:25:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Silage,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.40,0:25:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}青贮饲料是将湿润的草放进袋子中
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:03.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is grass that has been put in a bag which is wet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它将与草中自然释放的所有糖分
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's gonna ferment with all the sugars that naturally come off the grass,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一起发酵 这对奶牛有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is good for the cows with high sugar content.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.64,0:26:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}含糖量很高
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb was still annoyed that when my pigs had been in this field,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.84,0:26:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布还在生气 因为我的猪曾在这块地里待过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they'd made a bit of a mess of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们把这儿弄得有点乱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:24.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why have we got "Jeremy Keep Out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么有块 “杰里米 禁止入内”的标牌?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.76,0:26:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you keep fucking up this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.76,0:26:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰里米 禁止入内!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.92,0:26:28.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为你一直在瞎搞这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But nevertheless, it looked like we were getting a good crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但不管怎样 看起来我们的庄稼收成还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I quite like being a grass farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我非常喜欢当草农
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite sort of mathematical and pleasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.96,0:26:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有点数学的感觉 而且还令人愉悦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You think: "I've done that right."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会觉得:“我做对了” 就好像你修剪草坪时
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.20,0:26:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like you know when you mow your lawn and you don't have to go over
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.20,0:26:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用重新修理已经修好的地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.08,0:26:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a bit you've already done?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wonder if he mows his lawns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他恐怕不会自己修剪草坪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全部完工
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:57.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As soon as the grass harvest was finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:57.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们一完成割草...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.04,0:26:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we need to have a look at the fertiliser spreader.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.04,0:26:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得看看肥料撒施机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.92,0:27:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was time for the annual Red Tractor inspection,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.92,0:27:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - ...是时候进行
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.80,0:27:03.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}红拖拉机的年检了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where we have to prove the farm is clean and well run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在此检查中 我们必须证明农场干净且经营良好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.88,0:27:09.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. That's fine. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.88,0:27:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And given that Kaleb was now farm manager...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}考虑到卡莱布是新晋农场经理...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One, six, six, eight, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.44,0:27:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一、六、六、八、零 - 八、零
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.12,0:27:17.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eight, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:20.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Things this time round were very unstressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.04,0:27:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...这次的检查毫无压力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The NSF record book. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}NSF记录簿 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.32,0:27:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.32,0:27:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got your First Aid box up here, which is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有急救箱 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.40,0:27:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Correct signage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.40,0:27:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正确的标志?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.44,0:27:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.44,0:27:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sand bucket there. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是防火沙桶 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.76,0:27:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How are you doing? - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.76,0:27:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 早上好 - 你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.28,0:27:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You and mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.28,0:27:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 早上好 - 你和蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Everywhere, he just appears with mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他带着蘑菇到处转悠
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just live underground now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在就住在地下了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.68,0:27:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep, no matter how busy Kaleb was...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.68,0:27:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 不管卡莱布有多忙...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mushrooms were keeping me busier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇让我更加忙碌
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:50.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇 灰蚝菇 每250克 5英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is the Forth Road Bridge I've created
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.80,0:28:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我创造的蘑菇第四道路大桥
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because all day I've been selling mushrooms, constantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我整天都一直在卖蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.32,0:28:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we still have this many,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.32,0:28:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可我们还剩这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.28,0:28:19.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and tomorrow morning, there'll be this many again,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.28,0:28:19.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明天早上 又会有这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.32,0:28:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the next day, and the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.32,0:28:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后第二天 第三天也是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.64,0:28:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In fact, I had so many mushrooms
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.64,0:28:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 我有很多蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that besides selling them in the shop and the burger van...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.28,0:28:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了在商店和汉堡车里销售
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.96,0:28:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was now hawking them round local pubs,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.96,0:28:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在还在当地酒吧里兜售蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and even rival farm shops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至还在竞争对手的农场商店里卖
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had some last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.00,0:28:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}昨晚吃了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.72,0:28:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I cannot tell you how good they are. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.72,0:28:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我无法描述它们的味道有多好 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.88,0:28:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I cooked some last night. They're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.88,0:28:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我昨晚做了一些 太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus. I had these last night. They're fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 我昨晚吃了这蘑菇 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Even though my incredibly varied sales patter
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但尽管我“多样化”的销售技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:53.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was shifting some decent quantities...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}成功卖掉了相当多的蘑菇...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Five. We'll have 5 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.24,0:28:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五千克 我们要五千克
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.60,0:28:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}1.2.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.60,0:28:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}1.2
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}6.1 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}6.1千克
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:29:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was still barely scratching the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.40,0:29:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...卖掉的也只能算冰山一角
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For fuck's sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.28,0:29:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, there was still time amongst all the madness
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.28,0:29:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是 在所有疯狂之中 我仍有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to pause for the occasional treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.12,0:29:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}暂停片刻 放松一下
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.96,0:29:19.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got a big surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.96,0:29:19.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有个大惊喜给你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it a proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是要求婚吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.40,0:29:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every time you say you've got a surprise, I'm like: he's gonna propose!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.40,0:29:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次你说你有一个惊喜的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我都会想:“他要求婚了” 每次都是
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.88,0:29:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Remember the tree fell down?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.88,0:29:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}记得那棵倒下的大树吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The big beautiful one? We put it back up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.12,0:29:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们把它复位了 - 又大又漂亮的那棵吗?怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.40,0:29:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come and have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.40,0:29:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你来看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.80,0:29:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那棵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.32,0:29:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the tree we put back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.32,0:29:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是我们放回去的那棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.04,0:29:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm so happy. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.40,0:29:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.64,0:29:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause it had been down for 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.64,0:29:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它倒了六个月 但还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.80,0:29:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But do you know what's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.80,0:30:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你知道奇怪的是什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:03.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that the little branches are growing from absolutely everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些小树枝真的从各个地方长出来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is what's called "bursting" back into life, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就是所谓的 “重新焕发生机” 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It sure is. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done. That's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干得好 太棒了 - 这让我非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.92,0:30:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm really happy with that. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll think about the proposal, okay? I'm not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 我会考虑求婚的 好吗? 我还没准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.52,0:30:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, Mother Nature's ability to mend itself
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.52,0:30:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是 大自然母亲的自我修复能力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}isn't always a source of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并不总让人快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.84,0:30:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sometimes, it can be downright annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.84,0:30:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有时 它可能会非常烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.56,0:30:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A point brought into sharp focus...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.56,0:30:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一件事引起了关注...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, Christ Almighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.12,0:30:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.64,0:30:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...when Kaleb and I decided to resume work on the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.64,0:30:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...当卡莱布和我决定继续修堤坝时
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.44,0:30:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.44,0:30:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.08,0:30:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We just can't get to it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.08,0:30:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们再也去不了堤坝了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna have to come with a chainsaw and cut all this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得把电锯带来 然后把这些树都砍了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When were we last here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们上次来这里是什么时候?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.56,0:30:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It wasn't that long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.56,0:30:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在不久前
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.84,0:30:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now a jungle has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.84,0:30:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 这里长成了丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.60,0:31:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Happily, though, this meant I had an excuse to fire up WALL-E...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.60,0:31:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过幸运的是 这意味着我又可以使用沃利了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.24,0:31:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My most favourite machine in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.24,0:31:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}世界上我最爱的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.84,0:31:10.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.84,0:31:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The emotional support unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}情感支持小队
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.04,0:31:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The machine of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.04,0:31:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毁灭机器
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:20.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看它
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.96,0:31:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.96,0:31:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}切碎中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.52,0:31:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Atomising.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.52,0:31:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}粉碎中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is...? - What? Chainsaw trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are those just the front? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.12,0:31:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么?电锯防护裤 - 它覆盖前面...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.48,0:31:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if you're through like this and you hit yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.48,0:31:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以就像... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.80,0:31:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}they hit this and it tangles it up and stalls the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.80,0:31:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你像这么锯树 然后碰到自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.88,0:31:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}刀片碰到电锯防护裤 会跟它缠结在一起 然后熄灭引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.80,0:31:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is "Brokeback".
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.80,0:31:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它像《断背山》里的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.44,0:31:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.44,0:31:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:48.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes! Good dogs. Good dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.16,0:31:48.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 好狗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.88,0:31:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.64,0:31:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.64,0:31:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.32,0:31:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sit, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.32,0:31:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坐
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.28,0:32:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's gone. And that one's gone as well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.28,0:32:02.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 它跑了 那只现在也跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having cleared a new path to the dam site,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}清理出一条新的通往堤坝的道路后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we got into a construction-worker state of mind
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们开始按照 建筑工人的思维方式思考
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and moved onto the next job.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并开始进行下一项工作
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.28,0:32:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}吃午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That looks better now, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在看起来好多了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.48,0:32:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've had a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.48,0:32:30.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.36,0:32:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why are we using that tube
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.36,0:32:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么我们要用管道? 明明可以用枕木
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.12,0:32:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when we could use these sleepers instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:39.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I see. Just put the sleepers across and then put the...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道了 就把枕木放在上面 然后把...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.20,0:32:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we put the sleepers across there... Do you see what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.20,0:32:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们把枕木放在那里 你明白我的意思吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah, yeah. We dig out a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.08,0:32:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 明白 - 如果我们有挖掘机
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.64,0:32:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挖一个洞...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.92,0:32:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put some posts in, like this is... Exactly like behind of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.92,0:32:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}放几根立柱 就像这后面一样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:48.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:48.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 放几根立柱
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.16,0:32:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put some posts in. You slot one in, then another, then another.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.16,0:32:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后插一个进去 然后再插一个 再插一个
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then all you have to do, with the clay, is back up the sleepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.48,0:32:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你只需要 用黏土填充木枕之间的空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.12,0:32:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.12,0:32:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再然后
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.52,0:33:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The water simply comes over the top of the sleepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.52,0:33:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}水就能从枕木的上端
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.68,0:33:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}流过去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.40,0:33:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why didn't we do that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.40,0:33:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们之前怎么不这么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.76,0:33:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just got it in my head. We don't need a pipe, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.76,0:33:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直想着“我们得用管道” 但我们不需要管道 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.04,0:33:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll take the pipe out the way then, use it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.04,0:33:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们把管道拿开吧 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.28,0:33:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它用在其他地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.52,0:33:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Take it back to the farm. - We'll drive that back to the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.52,0:33:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 把它带回农场 - 我们会开车把那个带回农场
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.04,0:33:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Unhook it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}解开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.44,0:33:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You know what I've just worked out? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.44,0:33:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我刚想到了什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.24,0:33:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.64,0:33:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are now exactly back to where we began in January.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.64,0:33:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在完全回到了一月份 刚开始的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.48,0:33:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pipe at the top of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.48,0:33:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}管道在上面的田里 下面什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.32,0:33:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nothing done down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.92,0:33:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're never gonna finish this fucking dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.92,0:33:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们永远都修不好这个堤坝的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.16,0:33:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, now we had the sleeper plan in place,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.16,0:33:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是 现在我们有了枕木计划
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.08,0:33:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was much more optimistic that we would.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.08,0:33:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在更乐观地觉得我们能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pull it through. Is that proud enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.32,0:33:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它拉过去 犁一下后面 这犁得够深吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For the first time ever, I want to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.00,0:33:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有史以来第一次想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:34:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}further ahead than we were when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:34:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比我们到达这里时更进一步
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.48,0:34:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having prepped the site
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.48,0:34:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了工地现场 并将支撑立柱插入泥土后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and rammed some supporting posts into the mud,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.72,0:34:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was time to place the sleepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.72,0:34:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是时候放置枕木了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ready? - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 准备好了吗? - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:16.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Digger man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:16.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 挖掘工
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Butt-crack alert! Butt-crack alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.48,0:34:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小心屁股走光!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.28,0:34:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小心屁股走光!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.96,0:34:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Warning, warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.96,0:34:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}警告
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.80,0:34:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Down. More revs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.80,0:34:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Using the digger scoop,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.84,0:34:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}转速加大
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.96,0:34:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我用挖掘机的铲子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then pushed the foundation sleeper firmly into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把地基枕木牢牢地放到位
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.48,0:34:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.48,0:34:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It floats!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它会浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.00,0:34:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We hadn't thought of that, had we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.00,0:34:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们没考虑到这个问题 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.60,0:34:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll stand on it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.60,0:34:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得一直站在这上面
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.36,0:34:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you not bring any nails then at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.36,0:34:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你带钉子了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.32,0:34:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not... You'll never...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.32,0:34:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没...你永远不会...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.96,0:34:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you put a nail in over the top of the sleeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.96,0:34:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你把钉子钉在枕木上面
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.32,0:34:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you're creating a bigger crack, the water will get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.32,0:34:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会加大裂缝 水会流过去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.64,0:35:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just wanna put a nail there so I can get off it and then pack it.
