Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.04,0:38:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得他们会知道...他们测试过了?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.28,0:38:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They've done their testing, yeah. - They've done their testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.28,0:38:55.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们测试过了 没错 - 他们测试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.88,0:38:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And ours is even better because it comes from down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.88,0:38:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我们的更好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.00,0:38:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为是我们在那条路尽头那里种的 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.60,0:38:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no. They've done their testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.60,0:38:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们测试过了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.96,0:39:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Uh-huh. - So they've validated...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.96,0:39:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以他们验证过... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.80,0:39:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Yeah. - And verified the fact that...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.80,0:39:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 - ...这是事实...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.96,0:39:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because dehydrating, you're taking all the moisture out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.96,0:39:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为脱水 你要把水分脱干?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.00,0:39:08.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.00,0:39:08.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 要去除水分?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.12,0:39:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You remove the water content... - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.12,0:39:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 这样它就不会长...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.76,0:39:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So it doesn't grow... - It doesn't grow mould...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.76,0:39:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它不会发霉... - 细菌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Bacteria. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完全正确
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.44,0:39:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've done your Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Point checks?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.44,0:39:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你已经完成了 危害分析与关键控制点检查
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.92,0:39:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}HACCP. It's basic food standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.92,0:39:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}HACCP 这是食品...基本食品标准
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But no. No, no. This is from...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.48,0:39:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 这是农场之间的交易 所以你不必做这个检查
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is from farm to farm, so you don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.04,0:39:26.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Because... No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.04,0:39:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为 不用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.48,0:39:28.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's if you're selling to the wider market.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.48,0:39:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你要在更广阔的市场售卖 才需要做测试
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.32,0:39:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Charlie, I am allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.32,0:39:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有许可 查理 我有许可能在这里种番茄
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.28,0:39:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to grow tomatoes here and sell them in the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.28,0:39:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后在店里售卖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.40,0:39:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you're allowed to do that within a farm shop thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.40,0:39:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有许可在农场商店里这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.32,0:39:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No. - Once it's dried, it's dehydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.32,0:39:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不可以 - 但你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.08,0:39:42.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There's nothing in it but powder. But how do you know it's dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.08,0:39:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦食品烘干 它会脱水 它里面除了粉末什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.96,0:39:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你怎么知道它已经干了?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.28,0:39:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because it'll go into a powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.28,0:39:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它会变成粉末
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.08,0:39:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But after 3 weeks, it might be full of mould.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.08,0:39:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三周后 它可能就会发霉
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've sold it to somebody and then it's mouldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 你已经把它卖给了某个人 而它发霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.32,0:39:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it didn't last a year, it will have lasted 3 weeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.32,0:39:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它没法存放一年
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.52,0:39:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Listen. Okay. So what's your solution, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.52,0:39:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它能存放三周 - 我可以把...听着
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.16,0:39:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you'll have to test it. And then... Whoa, whoa. No, test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.16,0:39:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 那你有什么解决方案 查理? - 你必须拿去做测试
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.40,0:39:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后... - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.76,0:40:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There'll be a laboratory. We'll find out who tests it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.76,0:39:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 测试一下 有实验室的 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.76,0:40:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会找到能做测试的机构
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.80,0:40:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or we could just sell them as mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.80,0:40:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者我们就整天直接卖
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.12,0:40:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, that's a waste, though. Lion's mane in your tea in the morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.12,0:40:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 新鲜蘑菇 - 不行 但那太浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.80,0:40:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我想早上在你的茶或咖啡里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.44,0:40:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But nobody wants that. While we're doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.44,0:40:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 放猴头菇粉 那很棒 - 没人想放
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.76,0:40:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many men do that? None.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.76,0:40:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 当我们在... - 有多少男人做这事?没有
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.88,0:40:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not men that you know because you were born two millenniums ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.88,0:40:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你认识的男人都没有 因为你是个老古董
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.80,0:40:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This millennium people, they know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.80,0:40:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个千禧年的人 他们什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.88,0:40:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, as a solution...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.88,0:40:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我有一个解决方案 你为什么非得让它存放一年呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.08,0:40:22.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why do you need to put a year on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.52,0:40:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You just put six weeks, two months. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.52,0:40:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你就写六周或者两个月 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.92,0:40:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And that... And that covers my arse?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.92,0:40:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那样...因为... - 好的 那样就不会挨批评了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.32,0:40:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.32,0:40:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 因为... - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.76,0:40:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But you'll have to test it for that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.76,0:40:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你得测试它能存放那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.64,0:40:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.64,0:40:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.04,0:40:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Okay. Onwards. I shall go and flog 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.04,0:40:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我得去卖蘑菇了 - 好的 我还是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.16,0:40:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I might as well just keep on drying here, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.16,0:40:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 继续在这里烘干吧? - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.84,0:40:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. You need record what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.84,0:40:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得...你得记录你的步骤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.32,0:40:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.32,0:40:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.16,0:40:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I have dried this for two hours."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.16,0:40:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“我把它烘干了两个小时” - 我会拍一段视频 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.12,0:40:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I do a video, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.16,0:40:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Good. I'm going to take videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.16,0:40:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很好 HACCP快乐 - 我要拍一些视频
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.76,0:40:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. So, first of all, video.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.76,0:40:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 所以 首先 视频...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}First of all, I washed the mushrooms... No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.52,0:40:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我洗了蘑菇... 不 我没有
