Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.00,0:40:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我把它们从底座上切下来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There in a fridge, in a...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后在冰箱里把它们洗干净 在...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}First of all, I cut the bottom off and then I washed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 我切掉底部 然后清洗蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.44,0:41:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the whole kitchen has been, erm, certified.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.44,0:41:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整个厨房都通过了认证 然后这些是...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.00,0:41:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As we came to the end of June,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.00,0:41:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在已经到六月底了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.96,0:41:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}everything on the farm was looking wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.96,0:41:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场的一切看起来都很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.40,0:41:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, there was a big but,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.40,0:41:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但有一件事例外
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.12,0:41:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because Charlie was not a happy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.12,0:41:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为查理不开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put simply, the weather had not been playing ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}简单来说 是因为天气不配合
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.08,0:41:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}March had been the wettest for 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.08,0:41:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三月是四十年来最潮湿的一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}May had been freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.00,0:41:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五月冷得要命
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.08,0:41:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And June had been the hottest on record.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.08,0:41:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而六月是有纪录以来最热的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.16,0:41:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This looks a mess. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.16,0:41:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这看起来一团糟 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.80,0:41:46.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但为什么啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:49.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And already Charlie could see the effects of all this turbulence
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.20,0:41:49.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}通过检查卡莱布的油菜残余
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.76,0:41:54.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by examining what remained of Kaleb's oilseed rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.76,0:41:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理已经能够看出极端天气的影响了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.52,0:41:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, it hasn't pollinated brilliantly. It hasn't, erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.52,0:41:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}授粉的情况不太好...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got quite a few misses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.32,0:42:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们漏了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.96,0:42:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's probably when it was cold and miserable in April.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.96,0:42:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可能是四月的寒冷天气导致的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.76,0:42:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.76,0:42:05.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 它还没茁壮成长 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.04,0:42:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It hasn't thrived, has it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.04,0:42:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.84,0:42:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we're half a tonne an acre down. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.84,0:42:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们每英亩损失半吨
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.84,0:42:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.04,0:42:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Across 25 acres. 12 tonnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.04,0:42:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总共25英亩 损失12吨
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£5,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.52,0:42:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}5000英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.12,0:42:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a hit, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.12,0:42:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 影响巨大 不是吗? - 这种庄稼要盈利
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.48,0:42:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'll be a challenge in this crop
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.44,0:42:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to make a profit. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.44,0:42:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的非常困难 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}禁止入内 前方作物!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.32,0:42:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And once his happiness hoover was switched on,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.32,0:42:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦他打开了 他的“快乐吸水器”的开关
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he was sucking it up from everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他就会从各个地方汲取水分
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.36,0:42:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But they're not animals but they're definitely not plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.36,0:42:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 1.6... - 但它们没...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.48,0:42:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, here we go. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.48,0:42:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们不是动物 但也绝不是植物...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is bound to be good news, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 又来了 - 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.32,0:42:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}各位 这肯定是个好消息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.88,0:42:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why've you brought me barley?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.88,0:42:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你为什么给我带来... 这是什么 大麦?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.80,0:42:45.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So, I've just been for a crop walk. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.80,0:42:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我去巡视了作物 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.64,0:42:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The spring barley, you know it went in a bit later.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.64,0:42:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的春大麦的问题是 它种得有点晚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.80,0:42:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.80,0:42:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.64,0:42:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's now putting up all these little shoots here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.64,0:42:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它现在冒出了这些小嫩芽 这里 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.52,0:42:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't tell me that's bad to have all...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.52,0:42:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有这些嫩芽不会是坏事吧... - 它可能会塞满你的麦芽大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.08,0:42:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it might stuff your malting barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.96,0:43:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You might not be able to make beer out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.96,0:43:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可能无法用它来酿啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.48,0:43:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because you've got these very early mature ones
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.48,0:43:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为有这些非常早熟的大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then there's still enough oomph in the soil
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后土壤中仍然有足够的养分
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.04,0:43:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to throw out these little tillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.04,0:43:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}会催生出这些小分蘖
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.80,0:43:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And those late maturing ones will be a problem at harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.80,0:43:15.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些晚熟的在收割时会是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.44,0:43:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause we're gonna have some immature fat grains
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.44,0:43:19.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们会有一些未成熟的谷物 和成熟的谷物混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.68,0:43:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- in with the mature grains. - What--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.68,0:43:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么... - 因为你不能
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.92,0:43:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't physically go and take all these out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.92,0:43:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把这些剔出来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.64,0:43:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So, you know... What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.64,0:43:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.04,0:43:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's nothing we can do. We just have to hope
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.04,0:43:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们怎么办? - 我们无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.44,0:43:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that it's warm and dry, and they mature at harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.44,0:43:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只能希望天气温暖干燥 它们会在收获时成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.32,0:43:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Otherwise, there's no Hawkstone... from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.32,0:43:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}否则 这里就做不了豪客斯通了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.08,0:43:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you saying that this won't make... - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.08,0:43:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以你是说那不会做... - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.12,0:43:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What weather do we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.12,0:43:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要什么天气?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.88,0:43:44.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We just want not too hot, so these don't mature too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.88,0:43:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们只是不希望太热
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.76,0:43:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我不希望这些大麦太早成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.20,0:43:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Goldilocks temperature. Just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.20,0:43:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}二十五六度就刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.88,0:43:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Like today. - Like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.88,0:43:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就像今天 - 就像今天
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.72,0:43:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Until... - For the next six, eight weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.72,0:43:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 接下来的六周 不 是八周都这样 - 接下来的八周都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.72,0:43:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eight weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.56,0:43:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If the weather plays ball, we've got half a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.56,0:43:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果天气配合 我们有一半的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.60,0:43:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If it doesn't, I'm really worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.60,0:43:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果不配合 我真的...我很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.72,0:44:00.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, we know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.72,0:44:00.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我们都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.28,0:44:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.28,0:44:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道那事?你...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.60,0:44:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got barley and we've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.60,0:44:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有大麦 我们有...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And how is your spring barley doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.04,0:44:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的春大麦怎么样了?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.32,0:44:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seems to be okay I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.32,0:44:07.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.56,0:44:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you listening to this? Their spring barley's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.56,0:44:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在听吗?他们的春大麦没事
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.72,0:44:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.72,0:44:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的地在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.84,0:44:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Market Harborough. Leicestershire. - Leicestershire, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.84,0:44:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}马基特哈伯勒 莱斯特郡
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.92,0:44:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 莱斯特郡 没错 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.20,0:44:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what would you say about our spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.20,0:44:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那么你觉得我们的春...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.48,0:44:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The lower shoots are your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.48,0:44:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下面的嫩芽是个问题 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.96,0:44:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The lower shoots are the problem. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.96,0:44:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下面的嫩芽是个问题 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not what you want to be hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可不是你想听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.84,0:44:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.84,0:44:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie's gloomy arable forecast
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.96,0:44:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理对于种植作物的悲观预测 让农场经理和我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.12,0:44:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}put something of a dampener on proceedings
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.88,0:44:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as the farm manager and I met for a whiteboard catch-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.88,0:44:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在白板会议上有些沮丧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.80,0:44:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And found that Kaleb's outgoings had now gone through
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.80,0:44:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且我们发现卡莱布的支出 已经突破了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.32,0:44:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the £100,000 barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.32,0:44:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}十万英镑大关
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 101905.75英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.24,0:44:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's... it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.24,0:44:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这...太吓人了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.44,0:44:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're having to spend 102,000
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.44,0:44:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们花了十万零两千英镑 但我们无法控制结果
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.80,0:44:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and we can't control the outcome. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.80,0:44:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 地缘政治事件 天气
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.40,0:44:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Geopolitical events, weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.68,0:44:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The price at the end of the day. Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.68,0:44:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有最终的价格
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.52,0:45:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为 我是说... - 对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like going to a casino. If it's a £2 minimum bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.00,0:45:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像去赌场一样
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.68,0:45:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- you'll have a punt. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.68,0:45:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果最低赌注是2英镑 你就会尝试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.04,0:45:06.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A fun night out with your friends. If it's a £50,000 minimum bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.04,0:45:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 和你的朋友们一起享受愉快夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.24,0:45:09.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- you're not gonna bet. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.24,0:45:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果最低赌注是五万英镑... - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much would we spend five years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.32,0:45:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...你就不会下注了 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.12,0:45:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们五年前会花多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.16,0:45:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Probably half that, didn't we? 'Cause the fertiliser price has doubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.16,0:45:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能只有一半吧? 因为化肥价格翻了一番
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.36,0:45:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}78,000... Can you imagine spending £78,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.36,0:45:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}七万八...你能想象花七万八千英镑...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- On something you throw on the ground! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:23.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}买你要扔到地上的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.32,0:45:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.08,0:45:26.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't even measure its success.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.08,0:45:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你甚至无法衡量是否成功
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.84,0:45:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got four tonnes left over, yeah? Do you know why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.84,0:45:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我还剩四吨 你知道为什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because every time I come to the end of the run, I've turned it off quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.92,0:45:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为每次接近尾声时
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.92,0:45:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我都会更快地停下来 - 小心
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:35.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seed costs have gone up...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}种子的成本上涨了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.12,0:45:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by 35%, 40%.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.12,0:45:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}35% 40%
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.28,0:45:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Chemicals probably... You know, they've gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.28,0:45:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这... - 化学品...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.96,0:45:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, for example, glyphosate used to be £40 for a 20 litre can.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.96,0:45:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们也涨了 比如草甘膦 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以前一罐20升的才40英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.68,0:45:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. -£162 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.68,0:45:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 现在162英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£162 for a 20 litre can of glyphosate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.84,0:45:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一罐20升的草甘膦要162英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.80,0:45:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's weed killer basically? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.80,0:45:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 其实就是除草剂 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.40,0:45:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ. These figures are terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.40,0:45:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 这些数字太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.60,0:46:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The only positive is that while my side of the board was also in the red,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.60,0:46:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唯一令人振奋的是 虽然我这边的白板也亏损
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.40,0:46:10.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}some of my schemes did look like they'd soon be making a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.40,0:46:10.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我的一些计划 看起来很快就能盈利了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.88,0:46:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honey, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.88,0:46:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 蜂蜜... - 那会重返市场 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.48,0:46:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That will start coming back in again. - A couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.48,0:46:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 几个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.84,0:46:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er... Mushrooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.84,0:46:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.04,0:46:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.28,0:46:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - That could go green.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.28,0:46:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 这笔可能会回本盈利
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. Mustard, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 芥菜 谁知道呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.04,0:46:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That should be good money. It should go green.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.04,0:46:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那应该能赚一大笔 - 应该能盈利
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.44,0:46:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pigs are costing so much. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.44,0:46:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪的成本太高了 怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.88,0:46:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, to be honest, this is the total loss at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.88,0:46:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事 老实说 现在这完全是亏损
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.24,0:46:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But by the time all those that we're selling are sold...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.24,0:46:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但等我们把现在在卖的东西全部卖掉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.48,0:46:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - ...and sold through the shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.48,0:46:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 全部通过商店卖完... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.08,0:46:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We should. - That should go green.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.08,0:46:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 应该可以 - ...应该就能盈利了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.88,0:46:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on. Why is Wildfarm on my side of the board?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.88,0:46:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等 为什么野生农场 出现在我这边的白板上?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.48,0:46:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's your field.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.48,0:46:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是你的田
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.76,0:46:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but I thought it was your experiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.76,0:46:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但...我以为那是你的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.16,0:46:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, on your field.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.16,0:46:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是用你的田做的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.32,0:46:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How is it fair you make the decision... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.32,0:46:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这公平吗?是你做的决定吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.20,0:46:49.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And it's on my side? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.20,0:46:49.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 而它在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.72,0:46:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It should be on your side. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.72,0:46:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 不 - 它应该在你那边
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:07.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm fucking crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:08.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我他妈笑哭了 怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.68,0:47:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.52,0:47:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Never...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.00,0:47:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With Kaleb's side of the board looking so shaky,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.00,0:47:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布那边的白板看起来问题太大
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.96,0:47:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was vital that my unfarmed project succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.96,0:47:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的非耕地计划的成功至关重要
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we had to get a shift on,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们不得不加快脚步 确保刚获得议会许可
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.32,0:47:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}making sure the shop and the burger van,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.60,0:47:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}newly liberated from their council shackles,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.60,0:47:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}重获自由的商店和汉堡车
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.76,0:47:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}were ready and able to deal with the summer-holiday tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.76,0:47:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好接待暑假游客了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.44,0:47:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你已经看过第二季了... 现在就吃掉吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Check on, one burger, one bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.36,0:47:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个汉堡 一份培根 非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.64,0:47:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.72,0:47:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go. Measuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.72,0:47:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 走吧 - 正在测量
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.04,0:47:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant getting cracking with the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.04,0:47:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着要迅速建好停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.52,0:47:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.52,0:47:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们现在多少了? - 45
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.92,0:47:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}45. We'll go 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.92,0:47:44.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要走到68
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.36,0:47:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't think this would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.36,0:47:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这不会很难
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.56,0:47:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.56,0:47:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.80,0:47:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.80,0:47:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也不会很贵
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}53 metres.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}53米
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.68,0:47:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or time consuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.68,0:47:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也不会耗时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.40,0:47:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.40,0:47:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 就这里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.28,0:47:58.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我错了 大错特错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.32,0:47:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.88,0:48:04.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.68,0:48:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£80,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.68,0:48:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}八万英镑?我们为什么不做呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.60,0:48:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why don't we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.88,0:48:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll do it in two days. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.88,0:48:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们两天后就能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.56,0:48:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 搞不定
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.92,0:48:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}字幕翻译:匡思颖
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.92,0:48:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}创意监督 杨婕
